    "description": "Be Closer is a smart way to get closer to your family. Track where your family is after getting their permission.\r\n\r\n- Make sure your kids are safe by not texting them every few hours. GPS family tracker will help you!\r\n- Know where your mom or dad is and where to find them\r\n\r\nThe app is exclusively for the family.\r\nPLEASE NOTE: You can view the location of each family member in real time ONLY after receiving their permission.",
